# custom_docperm.json is exported from the role matrix. When a DocType's permissions are
# customised, Frappe copies every standard row into Custom DocPerm, including the framework's
# own "All" read row on Country (and later Request for Quotation). Those rows are ERPNext
# defaults, not grants made by this app, so the relaxed-permissions rule is noise here.
pvfss/fixtures/custom_docperm.json
:include .gitignore

